# Product editor field docs

`docs/product-editor/` is part of the catalogue contract.

When a product field is added, removed, renamed, moved between tabs, or its label, allowed values, draft/publish requiredness, category visibility, public redaction, or customer display changes:

1. Update the matching tab markdown under `docs/product-editor/`
2. Update `docs/product-editor/fields.yaml`
3. Update `CATALOGUE_SYSTEM_GUIDE.md` section 6 if a grouped visibility row is now wrong

A change is incomplete if the editor, API, or public site moved and those docs still describe the previous behaviour.

Do not invent display behaviour. Source it from the editor, `toPublicDetails`, and the public pages. OpenAPI remains authoritative for types.

Read `docs/product-editor/README.md` before filling or changing product fields.
